@startuml ViewSure_Sequence

actor User
participant "ProjectionStudioApp\n(App.tsx)" as App
participant "FileUploader\n(FileUploader.tsx)" as Uploader
participant "ProjectionAsset\n(fileLoader.ts)" as Asset
participant "WebGL Renderer\n(useProjectionRenderer)" as Renderer
participant "WCAG Helper\n(useWcagHelper)" as Wcag
participant "Analyzer\n(wcag/analyzer.ts)" as Analyzer
participant "WcagPreviewPanel" as Preview

== 資料読み込み ==
User -> App : アプリ画面を開く
App -> Uploader : ファイル選択ダイアログを開く
User -> Uploader : ファイルを選択/ドロップ
Uploader -> App : onFileSelected(file)
App -> Asset : loadProjectionAsset(file)
Asset --> App : ProjectionAsset {getFrame, getTextContent, ...}
App -> Renderer : loadImage(asset.getFrame(0))
Renderer --> App : 初回フレーム描画完了
App -> Wcag : setBrightness / setContrast

== ページ切替 ==
User -> App : Prev/Next ボタン
App -> Renderer : asset.getFrame(n) \\n→ loadImage()
Renderer --> App : 描画更新

== WCAG 解析 ==
User -> App : 「WCAG適合」ボタン
App -> Wcag : applyAdjustments()
Wcag -> Analyzer : analyzeProjectionAsset(asset)
Analyzer --> Wcag : DocumentAnalysis + issues
Wcag -> App : setBrightness / setContrast
Wcag --> Preview : TextOverlayPayload 更新
Preview --> User : 調整後テキストプレビュー表示

== PDF 書き出し ==
User -> App : 「PDF保存」ボタン
App -> Renderer : 各ページ loadImage()/captureFrame()
App -> Asset : getFrame(i) (繰り返し)
App --> User : 生成したPDFをダウンロード

@enduml
